              - Redesigned error pages and created static pages (pricing, legal notices, privacy policy).</br>
              - Redesigned registration and login pages.</br>
              - Implemented multilingual dynamic video designs.</br>
              - Built a Super Admin dashboard to create/modify design types, including creating/reading/editing JSON animation files directly.</br>
